---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | RIP Wallet"
  description="Privacy Policy for Tabs, the personal finance tracking app by RIP Wallet."
>
  <Navbar currentPath="/legal/privacy" />

  <header class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24 pb-12 animate-reveal">
    <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-yellow-600 mb-4">
      Tabs · Legal
    </p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-500 font-mono">
      <span>Last updated July 7, 2026</span>
      <span class="text-gray-300">·</span>
      <span>RIP Wallet</span>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-500 italic leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      The short version:
      <strong class="not-italic text-gray-900">Tabs does not collect, transmit, or have access to your financial data.</strong>
      Everything you enter — your debts, investments, balances, and payment history — is stored only on your device. We never see it.
    </p>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pb-32">
    <nav class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm mb-12 animate-reveal delay-1">
      <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gray-400 mb-4">On this page</p>
      <ol class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0">
        <li><a href="#not-collect" class="legal-toc-link"><span class="legal-toc-n">01</span>Information we do not collect</a></li>
        <li><a href="#on-device" class="legal-toc-link"><span class="legal-toc-n">02</span>Information stored on your device</a></li>
        <li><a href="#third-party" class="legal-toc-link"><span class="legal-toc-n">03</span>Third-party services we use</a></li>
        <li><a href="#export" class="legal-toc-link"><span class="legal-toc-n">04</span>Exporting your data</a></li>
        <li><a href="#sharing" class="legal-toc-link"><span class="legal-toc-n">05</span>Data sharing</a></li>
        <li><a href="#retention" class="legal-toc-link"><span class="legal-toc-n">06</span>Retention and deletion</a></li>
        <li><a href="#children" class="legal-toc-link"><span class="legal-toc-n">07</span>Children's privacy</a></li>
        <li><a href="#rights" class="legal-toc-link"><span class="legal-toc-n">08</span>Your rights</a></li>
        <li><a href="#changes" class="legal-toc-link"><span class="legal-toc-n">09</span>Changes to this policy</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact" class="legal-toc-link"><span class="legal-toc-n">10</span>Contact us</a></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <hr class="border-t border-gray-100 my-10" />

    <section id="not-collect" class="legal-section">
      <p class="legal-n">01</p>
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Information we do not collect</h2>
      <p>We do not require you to create an account, and the App does not have a backend server. We do not collect, store, or have any access to:</p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Your name, email address, or any other personal identifier</li>
        <li>The debts, investments, balances, or payment history you enter into the App</li>
        <li>Your device's location</li>
        <li>Your contacts, photos, or camera</li>
        <li>Any usage analytics, crash reports, or behavioral tracking data</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="on-device" class="legal-section">
      <p class="legal-n">02</p>
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Information stored on your device</h2>
      <p>All financial data you enter into Tabs — debt and investment names, amounts, interest rates, payment history, and related notes — is stored locally on your device only (using SwiftData on iOS and Room on Android). This data:</p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Never leaves your device unless you explicitly export it yourself</li>
        <li>Is deleted permanently if you uninstall the App</li>
        <li>Is not backed up to any server we operate, because we don't operate one</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="third-party" class="legal-section">
      <p class="legal-n">03</p>
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Third-party services we use</h2>

      <h3 class="legal-h3">Currency exchange rates</h3>
      <p>To convert amounts between currencies, the App makes an anonymous request to a public exchange-rate API (open.er-api.com). This request does not include any of your personal or financial data — it only asks for current exchange rates and is indistinguishable from any other visitor's request.</p>

      <h3 class="legal-h3">In-app purchases</h3>
      <p>Tabs offers a one-time optional purchase ("Tabs Pro") processed entirely by the Apple App Store or Google Play Store, depending on your device. Payment information (card details, billing address, etc.) is collected and processed by Apple or Google under their own privacy policies — we never receive or have access to it. We only receive confirmation of whether a purchase was completed, so the App can unlock Pro features.</p>

      <h3 class="legal-h3">Notifications</h3>
      <p>If you enable payment or deposit reminders, the App schedules local notifications directly on your device (using <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm">UNUserNotificationCenter</code> on iOS and WorkManager on Android). These reminders are generated and delivered entirely on-device — no notification content or scheduling data is sent to us or to any push notification server.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="export" class="legal-section">
      <p class="legal-n">04</p>
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Exporting your data</h2>
      <p>The App lets you export your data as a CSV file. This file is created locally on your device, and you choose where to send or save it (e.g. via your device's native share sheet). We have no visibility into this process and never receive a copy of the exported file.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="sharing" class="legal-section">
      <p class="legal-n">05</p>
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Data sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your data with anyone, because we do not collect it in the first place. There is nothing for us to share.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="retention" class="legal-section">
      <p class="legal-n">06</p>
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Retention and deletion</h2>
      <p>Because your data lives only on your device, you are always in full control of it:</p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Delete individual debts, investments, or payment entries at any time within the App</li>
        <li>Uninstalling the App permanently deletes all locally stored data</li>
        <li>We have no copy of your data to retain or delete on our end</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="children" class="legal-section">
      <p class="legal-n">07</p>
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>Tabs is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect information from children. Since the App does not collect personal information from any user, this applies equally regardless of age.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="rights" class="legal-section">
      <p class="legal-n">08</p>
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Your rights</h2>
      <p>Because we do not collect or store your personal data on any server, most data-access, correction, and deletion requests (such as those under GDPR or CCPA) are already fully within your control directly in the App or by uninstalling it. If you have questions about your data or this policy, contact us at the email below.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="changes" class="legal-section">
      <p class="legal-n">09</p>
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time, for example to reflect new features (such as optional iCloud sync, if introduced in the future). If we make material changes, we will update the "Last updated" date above. We encourage you to review this page periodically.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="legal-section">
      <p class="legal-n">10</p>
      <h2 class="legal-h2">Contact us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, reach out any time — we read every message.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 p-6 bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-4">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gray-400 mb-1">Questions about this policy</p>
          <p class="text-lg font-bold m-0">RIP Wallet</p>
        </div>
        <a href="mailto:hola@spentapp.co" class="font-mono text-sm text-yellow-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-75">hola@spentapp.co</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-sm text-gray-500">
        Also see the <a href="/legal/terms" class="text-yellow-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-75">Terms of Use</a> for Tabs.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  .legal-section {
    margin-top: 48px;
    scroll-margin-top: 80px;
  }
  .legal-n {
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #ca8a04;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .legal-h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    color: #111827;
  }
  .legal-h3 {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 24px 0 8px;
    color: #111827;
  }
  .legal-section p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #374151;
    margin: 14px 0;
    max-width: 66ch;
  }
  .legal-list {
    margin: 14px 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    max-width: 64ch;
  }
  .legal-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 22px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 9px 0;
    color: #374151;
  }
  .legal-list li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.65em;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    background: #facc15;
    border-radius: 1px;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }
  .legal-toc-link {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #111827;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 3px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .legal-toc-link:hover {
    color: #ca8a04;
    border-bottom-color: #ca8a04;
  }
  .legal-toc-n {
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #9ca3af;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    flex: none;
  }
  .legal-toc-link:hover .legal-toc-n {
    color: #ca8a04;
  }

  @keyframes reveal {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  .animate-reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    animation: reveal 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
  }
  .delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
</style>
